# FINANO product repository

- This repo deploys the product (Docker, backend pip install, frontend build) when `frontend/`, `backend/`, or compose files change.
- Pitch deck static site lives in `pitch-deck/`; prefer editing the flat copy in `../finano-pitch-deck` and running `push-pitch.ps1` there to avoid accidental full Docker rebuilds.
- Pushing only `pitch-deck/**` changes triggers fast deploy (~1–2 min), not full `deploy-app`.
